            <ArticleTitle>Cost implications of using an atraumatic dressing in the treatment of acute wounds.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>224-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Three randomised controlled trials have compared a soft silicone dressing with traditional treatment on acute wounds. This analysis shows the former reduced overall costs by accelerating healing and reducing wound pain and resource use.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
